Row 1 (left to right):
1. A clenched fist driving in hard from the upper left on a steep diagonal, thick forearm behind it, one spiky impact burst where the knuckles land.
2. Two heavy axes crossed in a wide X, caught mid-swing, heads biting outward.
3. A warrior's upper body front-on — head, shoulders and chest only — with one big plus-shaped cross cut through the chest as a white gap.

Row 2 (left to right):
4. The same warrior's upper body front-on — head, shoulders and chest only — hardened into a few thick armor plates separated by white gaps.
5. One axe swinging hard on a diagonal, three upward chevrons stacked beside its handle, growing larger toward the top.
6. A war horn tilted on a diagonal, bell pointing up and to the right, three thick wedge-shaped sound blasts coming out of the bell.

Row 3 (left to right):
7. A war banner on a pole whipping hard in the wind, three thick chevrons sweeping off its tip.
8. A shouting head in profile, head and neck only, mouth wide open, three thick sound arcs blasting out of the mouth.
9. A round helmet in profile split by one thick crack, three thick sound arcs slamming into it from the left.
